{"id":"2183acadc6112b0b","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HValue.md","title":"HValue","display":"HValue","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"HValue","parameters":["D","R","m","j","h","z","o","v","a","b"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"HValue"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>D</span><span>R</span><span>m</span><span>j</span><span>h</span><span>z</span><span>o</span><span>v</span><span>a</span><span>b</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Heyting 代数语义。有序参数：<code>D</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>m</code>、<code>j</code>、<code>h</code>、<code>z</code>、<code>o</code>、<code>v</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>。</p>\n<p>在给定集合 Heyting 代数上的独立求值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ HValue D R m j h z o v a b)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z4868 (@ HValueProof D R m j h z o v a b z4868))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b47b7b6a6f047db\" href=\"?note=8b47b7b6a6f047db\" title=\"ZFC_HValueProof\">HValueProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ HValue D R m j h z o v a b)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_HValueProof","status":"resolved","id":"8b47b7b6a6f047db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_HValueProof|HValueProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":854,"backlinks":[{"id":"b0eb5443b164e777","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HValue|HValue]]"},{"id":"06ea58c3b2d480a5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_HValue|HValue]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-748","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_HValue|HValue]]"},{"id":"feef9aadd0063e8a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_HValue|HValue]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","8b47b7b6a6f047db","593f9bdab4d60707"]}